### Create Group Savings
POST {{host}}/savings/group
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

{
  "name": "Test5 group Savings",
  "goals": "I am very sure that this works",
  "mission": "some mission",
  "vision": "some vision",
  "membershipRequirements": "some requirements",
  "rulesAndRegulations": "some rules and regulation",
  "savingAmount": 200,
  "savingFrequency": "BI_WEEKLY",
  "meetingLocation": "Somewhere in the desert",
  "currency": "NGN"
}

### Get group saving by Id
GET{{host}}/savings/group/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Get user's group savings
GET{{host}}/savings/group?size=20&page=0
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

### Create Group Savings Transaction
POST {{host}}/savings/group/record-transaction/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

{
  "amount": 500.35,
  "description": "Testing group transactions",
  "memberId": "054a080c-453e-44cc-8476-119e5f9765c6"
}

### Invite user to group saving
POST {{host}}/savings/group/invite/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b/81f85c2a-61a4-4a99-84a5-ee2b8155cced
Authorization: {{customer_token}}


### Invite user to group saving (Updated)
POST {{host}}/savings/group/send-invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{token}}

{
  "customerId": "32328829-8abe-4fce-bcd7-bc39186d8c71",
  "groupId": "85d8e840-bf92-4f85-981a-213c125b663b"
}

### User request loan
POST {{host}}/savings/group/loans/request
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

{
  "groupId": "1a915c0e-9afe-4400-9e68-49c3915e8904",
  "amount": 200
}

### Get all loans for group by ID
GET {{host}}/savings/group/1a915c0e-9afe-4400-9e68-49c3915e8904/loans
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Get group loan by ID
GET {{host}}/savings/group/loans/11fec02f-2f45-4afb-a6f9-30ce7487c277
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Approve group loan by ID
POST {{host}}/savings/group/loans/11fec02f-2f45-4afb-a6f9-30ce7487c277/approve
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Reject group loan by ID
POST {{host}}/savings/group/loans/30fcb6e2-5b33-4367-a5b8-7969a8544a9c/reject
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### User requests to join group
POST{{host}}/savings/group/request-join/a9163b72-a06b-4be0-ba72-4a4898e0fb6f
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}


